From ed7a029ae35a04246e90de8dbf33c8fe0aea14c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:19:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/37] AOSCOS: Expose the native X11 touchpad build switch

Upstream-Id: 2ac04a2463b4604a1c67b907033215edb1d00ce2

Add BUILD_KCM_TOUCHPAD_X11 to the generated header required by the restored
X11 touchpad implementation. The mouse build-option removal did not remove
this switch.

Assisted-by: gpt-6.1-sol
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
---
 config-build-options.h.cmake | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/config-build-options.h.cmake b/config-build-options.h.cmake
index 2f67d3c67..1a8a94231 100644
--- a/config-build-options.h.cmake
+++ b/config-build-options.h.cmake
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 #cmakedefine01 BUILD_KCM_MOUSE_KWIN_WAYLAND
 #cmakedefine01 BUILD_KCM_MOUSE_X11
 #cmakedefine01 BUILD_KCM_TOUCHPAD_KWIN_WAYLAND
+#cmakedefine01 BUILD_KCM_TOUCHPAD_X11
